snippet box* "banner comment with comment chars" b
`!p snip.rv = "".join([vim.eval("split(&commentstring, '%s')[0]")]*int(vim.eval("&tw")))`
`!p 
cs      = vim.eval("split(&commentstring, '%s')[0]")
tw      = int(vim.eval("&tw"))
ll      = (tw - len(t[1]) - 2) // 2
snip.rv = "".join([cs] * ll)
` $1 `!p 
cs      = vim.eval("split(&commentstring, '%s')[0]")
tw      = int(vim.eval("&tw"))
ll      = (tw - len(t[1]) - 2) // 2 + (len(t[1]) % 2)
snip.rv = "".join([cs] * ll)
`
`!p snip.rv = "".join([vim.eval("split(&commentstring, '%s')[0]")]*int(vim.eval("&tw")))`
$0
endsnippet

